#: ../../library/jwt.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`jwt` --- JSON Web Tokens"
msgstr ":mod:`jwt` --- JSON Web Token"

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:7
msgid ""
"A small implementation of the JSON Web Token (JWT) standard for MicroPython."
" JWT is a compact, URL-safe container for a JSON payload that the issuer "
"signs so the verifier can detect tampering and expiry."
msgstr ""
"Implementasi kecil dari standar JSON Web Token (JWT) untuk MicroPython. JWT "
"adalah wadah kompak dan aman untuk URL yang berisi payload JSON yang "
"ditandatangani oleh penerbit agar pemeriksa dapat mendeteksi pemalsuan dan "
"kedaluwarsa."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:11
msgid "This MicroPython port is intentionally tiny:"
msgstr "Port MicroPython ini sengaja dibuat sangat kecil:"

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:13
msgid ""
"Only **HS256** (HMAC with SHA-256) is supported. RSA / ECDSA / EdDSA "
"algorithms are not implemented; the issuer and verifier must share a "
"symmetric secret key."
msgstr ""
"Hanya **HS256** (HMAC dengan SHA-256) yang didukung. Algoritma RSA / ECDSA /"
" EdDSA tidak diimplementasikan; penerbit dan pemeriksa harus berbagi kunci "
"rahasia simetris."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:16
msgid ""
"The optional ``exp`` (expiration) claim is honored. Other registered claims "
"(``nbf``, ``iat``, ``iss``, ``aud``, ``sub``, ``jti``) are passed through "
"unchanged in the payload but **not validated**; the application checks them "
"if it cares."
msgstr ""
"Klaim opsional ``exp`` (kedaluwarsa) dihormati. Klaim terdaftar lainnya (\\ "
"``nbf``\\ , ``iat``\\ , ``iss``\\ , ``aud``\\ , ``sub``\\ , ``jti``\\ ) "
"diteruskan tanpa perubahan dalam payload tetapi **tidak divalidasi**\\ ; "
"aplikasi memeriksanya sendiri jika diperlukan."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:20
msgid "No key-rotation, JWKS, or audience-list handling."
msgstr "Tidak ada penanganan rotasi kunci, JWKS, atau daftar audiens."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:23
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Fungsi"

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:27
msgid ""
"Encode *payload* into a signed JWT and return the resulting compact "
"serialization (a ``str`` of the form ``\"header.payload.signature\"``, each "
"segment Base64-URL-encoded)."
msgstr ""
"Enkode *payload* menjadi JWT yang ditandatangani dan kembalikan serialisasi "
"kompak yang dihasilkan (sebuah ``str`` berbentuk "
"``\"header.payload.signature\"``\\ , setiap segmen dikodekan dengan "
"Base64-URL)."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:31
msgid "*payload*"
msgstr "*payload*"

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:32
msgid ""
"A JSON-serializable dict of claims. Standard claims (``exp``, ``iat``, "
"``sub``, ...) are passed through verbatim; custom application keys are "
"allowed."
msgstr ""
"Dict klaim yang dapat diserialisasi ke JSON. Klaim standar (\\ ``exp``\\ , "
"``iat``\\ , ``sub``\\ , ...) diteruskan verbatim; kunci aplikasi kustom "
"diperbolehkan."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:36 ../../library/jwt.rst:55
msgid "*key*"
msgstr "*key*"

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:37
msgid ""
"The shared HMAC secret. ``bytes`` is preferred; ``str`` is UTF-8-encoded "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Rahasia HMAC bersama. ``bytes`` lebih diutamakan; ``str`` dikodekan secara "
"otomatis ke UTF-8."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:40
msgid "*algorithm*"
msgstr "*algorithm*"

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:41
msgid ""
"Must be ``\"HS256\"`` (the default). Anything else raises "
":exc:`exceptions.InvalidAlgorithmError`."
msgstr ""
"Harus berupa ``\"HS256\"`` (nilai default). Nilai lain akan memunculkan "
":exc:`exceptions.InvalidAlgorithmError`\\ ."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:46
msgid ""
"Verify *token*'s signature and (if present) its ``exp`` claim, and return "
"the decoded payload dict. Raises a subclass of :exc:`exceptions.PyJWTError` "
"on any failure -- the caller usually catches the base class."
msgstr ""
"Verifikasi tanda tangan *token* dan (jika ada) klaim ``exp``\\ -nya, lalu "
"kembalikan dict payload yang didekode. Memunculkan subkelas "
":exc:`exceptions.PyJWTError` pada kegagalan apa pun -- pemanggil biasanya "
"menangkap kelas dasarnya."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:51
msgid "*token*"
msgstr "*token*"

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:52
msgid ""
"The compact JWT string produced by :func:`encode` (or any compatible "
"issuer)."
msgstr ""
"String JWT kompak yang dihasilkan oleh :func:`encode` (atau penerbit "
"kompatibel apa pun)."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:56
msgid "The shared HMAC secret. Must match the key used at encode time."
msgstr ""
"Rahasia HMAC bersama. Harus cocok dengan kunci yang digunakan saat enkoding."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:58
msgid "*algorithms*"
msgstr "*algorithms*"

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:59
msgid ""
"The list of algorithms the caller is willing to accept. ``HS256`` must be "
"present, and the token's header ``alg`` must be in the list. Defaults to "
"``[\"HS256\"]``."
msgstr ""
"Daftar algoritma yang bersedia diterima oleh pemanggil. ``HS256`` harus ada,"
" dan ``alg`` header token harus ada dalam daftar. Default-nya adalah "
"``[\"HS256\"]``\\ ."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:63
msgid "**Raises:**"
msgstr "**Memunculkan:**"

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:65
msgid ""
":exc:`exceptions.InvalidAlgorithmError` -- ``HS256`` is not in *algorithms*,"
" or the token's header ``alg`` is anything other than ``HS256``."
msgstr ""
":exc:`exceptions.InvalidAlgorithmError` -- ``HS256`` tidak ada dalam "
"*algorithms*\\ , atau ``alg`` header token bukan ``HS256``\\ ."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:68
msgid ""
":exc:`exceptions.InvalidTokenError` -- the token is malformed (does not "
"split into three Base64-URL segments, or a segment fails to decode / parse "
"as JSON)."
msgstr ""
":exc:`exceptions.InvalidTokenError` -- token tidak terbentuk dengan benar "
"(tidak terbagi menjadi tiga segmen Base64-URL, atau segmen gagal didekode / "
"diurai sebagai JSON)."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:71
msgid ""
":exc:`exceptions.InvalidSignatureError` -- the signature does not match the "
"recomputed HMAC over the header and payload."
msgstr ""
":exc:`exceptions.InvalidSignatureError` -- tanda tangan tidak cocok dengan "
"HMAC yang dihitung ulang dari header dan payload."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:73
msgid ""
":exc:`exceptions.ExpiredSignatureError` -- the payload contains an ``exp`` "
"claim whose value is less than the current Unix time. The camera's clock "
"must be set for this check to be meaningful; see :func:`ntptime.settime`."
msgstr ""
":exc:`exceptions.ExpiredSignatureError` -- payload berisi klaim ``exp`` yang"
" nilainya kurang dari waktu Unix saat ini. Jam kamera harus disetel agar "
"pemeriksaan ini bermakna; lihat :func:`ntptime.settime`\\ ."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:79
msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "Exception"

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:81
msgid ""
"All exceptions are nested under the module attribute ``jwt.exceptions``."
msgstr "Semua exception berada di bawah atribut modul ``jwt.exceptions``\\ ."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:85
msgid ""
"Base class for every JWT failure. Catch this if you do not need to "
"distinguish among the cases below."
msgstr ""
"Kelas dasar untuk setiap kegagalan JWT. Tangkap ini jika Anda tidak perlu "
"membedakan kasus-kasus di bawah ini."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:90
msgid ""
"The token is structurally invalid -- wrong number of segments, a segment "
"that fails Base64 decode, or JSON that fails to parse. Subclass of "
":exc:`exceptions.PyJWTError`."
msgstr ""
"Token tidak valid secara struktural -- jumlah segmen salah, segmen yang "
"gagal didekode Base64, atau JSON yang gagal diurai. Subkelas dari "
":exc:`exceptions.PyJWTError`\\ ."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:96
msgid ""
"The token's algorithm is not in the caller-accepted list, or the caller "
"asked for an algorithm other than ``HS256``. Subclass of "
":exc:`exceptions.PyJWTError`."
msgstr ""
"Algoritma token tidak ada dalam daftar yang diterima pemanggil, atau "
"pemanggil meminta algoritma selain ``HS256``\\ . Subkelas dari "
":exc:`exceptions.PyJWTError`\\ ."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:102
msgid ""
"The token's signature does not match the HMAC computed from the header and "
"payload using the supplied key. Subclass of :exc:`exceptions.PyJWTError`."
msgstr ""
"Tanda tangan token tidak cocok dengan HMAC yang dihitung dari header dan "
"payload menggunakan kunci yang diberikan. Subkelas dari "
":exc:`exceptions.PyJWTError`\\ ."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:108
msgid ""
"The token's ``exp`` claim is in the past. Subclass of "
":exc:`exceptions.PyJWTError`. The camera's wall-clock time must be set (via "
":func:`ntptime.settime`) for this check to be meaningful."
msgstr ""
"Klaim ``exp`` token sudah lampau. Subkelas dari "
":exc:`exceptions.PyJWTError`\\ . Waktu jam kamera harus disetel (melalui "
":func:`ntptime.settime`\\ ) agar pemeriksaan ini bermakna."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:113
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Contoh"

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:115
msgid "A symmetric-secret issue/verify cycle::"
msgstr "Siklus penerbitan/verifikasi dengan rahasia simetris::"

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:138
msgid ""
"The same secret is used to sign and verify, so the verifier must hold the "
"key the issuer used. For services where the camera is the issuer (handing "
"out tokens to a paired phone), keep the secret on the camera filesystem and "
"treat it like any other long-lived credential -- see "
":doc:`/openmvcam/tutorial/production/tls/operations`."
msgstr ""
"Rahasia yang sama digunakan untuk menandatangani dan memverifikasi, sehingga"
" pemeriksa harus memegang kunci yang digunakan penerbit. Untuk layanan di "
"mana kamera adalah penerbit (membagikan token ke ponsel yang dipasangkan), "
"simpan rahasia di sistem file kamera dan perlakukan seperti kredensial "
"jangka panjang lainnya -- lihat "
":doc:`/openmvcam/tutorial/production/tls/operations`\\ ."

#: ../../library/jwt.rst:146
msgid ""
"This module relies on :mod:`hmac` and :mod:`hashlib`, both of which are "
"built into the camera. No external configuration is needed. Keys may be any "
"length, but the HMAC construction is most useful with keys at least as long "
"as the SHA-256 block size (32 bytes)."
msgstr ""
"Modul ini bergantung pada :mod:`hmac` dan :mod:`hashlib`\\ , keduanya sudah "
"built-in ke dalam kamera. Tidak diperlukan konfigurasi eksternal. Kunci "
"boleh memiliki panjang berapa pun, tetapi konstruksi HMAC paling berguna "
"dengan kunci yang setidaknya sepanjang ukuran blok SHA-256 (32 byte)."
